---
title: ISR Offloading (Deferred Interrupt Handling)
---
flowchart LR
    TIM["TIM7<br/>1 kHz hardware timer"]
    ISR["TIM7_IRQHandler<br/>counts ms,<br/>never touches LEDs"]
    subgraph Tasks["4 behaviour tasks"]
        A["LedHeartbeat_TaskEntry<br/>every 5 ms"]
        B["BlinkSteady_TaskEntry<br/>every 10 ms"]
        C["PwmLedSoftware_TaskEntry<br/>every 1 ms"]
        D["PwmLedHardware_TaskEntry<br/>every 5 ms"]
    end

    TIM -->|"interrupt"| ISR
    ISR -->|"xTaskNotifyFromISR<br/>every tick"| C
    ISR -->|"xTaskNotifyFromISR<br/>every 5 ms"| A
    ISR -->|"xTaskNotifyFromISR<br/>every 5 ms"| D
    ISR -->|"xTaskNotifyFromISR<br/>every 10 ms"| B